        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This suit of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+2 greater resilient elven chain",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " was worn by the elven hero Kyloss Syndar. The armor served him well, but eventually he fell in battle against the demonic hydra Slithermaw. As Kyloss slew the demonic beast, its fangs pierced his chest and mortally wounded the elf. The armor retains several ragged holes along the chest and abdomen where the hydra's teeth damaged it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Slithermaw's Bane",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " grants its wearer poison resistance 10, and the resilient rune increases the item bonus on saving throws versus poison by 1 (to +3)."
          }
        ]
      },
