          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Poison wells up from the armor's links to seep into the triggering creature's body, causing it to suffer wracking pains as if it were being stung by thousands of angry wasps. The triggering creature takes "
